        <p>
          The Board of Directors of <strong>Latur District Central Cooperative Bank Ltd., Latur (Latur DCCB)</strong> in its meeting on <strong>20 July 2026</strong> approved the Phase 1 merit selection list covering 70% of total vacancies (263 selected candidates out of 375 total posts). The Phase 1 results were published on <strong>28 July 2026</strong>.
