        </h2>
        <p>
          As per the directives mandated by Maharashtra Government Resolution (GR) dated <strong>15 June 2018</strong>:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-sm text-text-main">
          <li><strong>20% Category Quota:</strong> A merit waiting list containing eligible candidates equal to exactly <strong>20% of the selection list</strong> for each post category must be published.</li>
          <li><strong>365-Day Validity Period:</strong> The waiting list shall remain active and legally enforceable for <strong>365 days (1 full year)</strong> from the date of issuance of the first appointment orders.</li>
          <li><strong>Revised Waiting List Issuance:</strong> In accordance with these regulations, the bank has published the Revised Waiting List corresponding to the 28.07.2026 results.</li>
        </ul>

